    "s01": { "translation": "May Your sacrament, O Lord, always keep us and guard us from the assaults of the devil. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
